{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"前一段那种越坚持越吃力的焦灼暂时松开了，出现一种更轻快、甚至近乎欢欣的自在；但这份自在并不完全无忧，中间仍会掠过紧张和黯淡，像是已经无法再毫无保留地相信眼前的满足。\",\"thread\":\"前面真正造成压力的，不是那份确定本身，而是它被要求承担整件事。到了这里，它暂时不必证明自己足以解决全部，人便能够单纯地享用它确实给出的东西，于是先前的郑重有了轻快和欢欣的一面。可人已经知道它的限度，这份知道不会因为此刻舒服就消失，所以满足可以很真，却不再是毫无疑问的满足；偶尔浮起的不安，也不是重新否定它，而是已经不能把局部的好误认成全部已经安顿。\",\"used\":\"第2段已经经验到：一份有限但真实的确定能够给人力量和满足；它之所以后来变得焦灼，是因为被进一步依靠时显出了不能承担全部的限度。\",\"new\":[\"一种有限的确定，在不再被要求承担全部时，仍然可以重新成为真实而轻松的满足。\",\"知道某种满足的限度之后，人仍能享受它，但已经无法恢复到把它当作完整答案时那种毫无保留的安心。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8b09f8d4-5f4d-4e5a-becb-28f2f6f5c5e3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T224250632589Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.047, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:43:22.693218+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "41f8fa3c205f8f03c7bc16ab09fda3195b1a2680fe6bc3156170efad82dd97ab", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c